 "requested_at": "2026-11-13T20:17:05.844611Z",
 "text": "{\n  \"verdict\": \"void\",\n  \"section\": \"108\",\n  \"quote\": \"permit automatic debiting of the tenant’s or prospective tenant’s account at a financial institution, automatic charging of a credit card or any other form of automatic payment for the payment of rent.\",\n  \"reason\": \"Section 108 prohibits a tenancy agreement from requiring a tenant to permit automatic debiting for the payment of rent. In combination with Section 4, any provision requiring automatic debit is inconsistent with the Act and void.\"\n}",
